GPU dispatch for Tip5 batch hashing.

Two insertion points where the prover hashes table rows into Merkle
tree leaves — the second most expensive operation (~20-30% of prove).

1. stark.rs: quotient segment row hashing (FRI domain)
2. master_table.rs: FRI domain row hashing (main + aux tables)

Both check gpu_accelerator() and fall back to rayon parallel CPU
hashing when no GPU is registered.

